public class LateFeeAccount {String regNo;double total;LateFeeAccount(String r,double t){regNo=r;total=t;}final double calculateLateFee(int days){return total*days/100;}final void printSummary(int days){if(days<=0)System.out.println(regNo+" - On time, no late fee");else System.out.println(regNo+" | Total Fee: Rs "+total+" | Late Fee: Rs "+calculateLateFee(days));}public static void main(String[]x){String[]r={"RA001","RA002","RA003","RA004"};double[]t={200000,150000,180000,220000};int[]d={10,0,-2,5};for(int i=0;i<r.length;i++)new LateFeeAccount(r[i],t[i]).printSummary(d[i]);}}
